{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-sonnet-4-6","id":"msg_01C1dLySo7Ak9Ai98jryxk7j","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"Now I have a clear understanding of the task. Let me now read the KB files listed in the manifest to understand what's available. The manifest lists:\n1. EMPTY-KB.md\n2. T1.compile.research.md\n3. T3.compile.research.md\n\nLet me read these files to understand their content. The task (gap-tsf-blasting-guidance.prompt.md) asks for research on guidance documents for blasting effects on TSFs - for a tailings storage facility project AR-S2J2J.R.\n\nThe SLOTS are:\n1. Authoritative Guidance Documents Covering Blasting Effects on TSFs\n2. South African versus International Applicability of Sources\n3. Quantitative Acceptance Criteria versus Project-Specific Assessment\n4. Report Framing to Distinguish Criteria, Monitoring Requirements, and Assumptions\n5. Source-Backed Terminology for TSF Response to Blasting\n\nI need to read through the KB files to compile the research output as T8.research.md.","signature":""}],"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":1,"cache_creation_input_tokens":9348,"cache_read_input_tokens":35915,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":9348,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":0},"output_tokens":8,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"global"},"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"193e9b03-f0e0-48bb-82cd-24114a1d1cbc","uuid":"d4592f1a-75a6-4495-8c7d-842a591eafd7","request_id":"req_011CcmNaKWis3eCrkbt2rN6c"}
